				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b><a href="#c568175240219530394">Scyrenus</a></b>:</div>Doubt. Before the AI-prompt era, I already had a library of games that I would never finish in my lifetime because of the obvious human mortality.<br><br>AI will help me slow down on purchases and focus on the old stuff. </blockquote>The neoluddite attitude will fade with time, newer generations will embrace the future which is AI, same thing happened with horse drawn carriages, they were eventually replaced by the combustion engine. Not using AI is vastly ineffecient.			</div>
