			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_568175523960777299">
				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b><a href="#c568175523960767172">diesoon</a></b>:</div><blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b><a href="#c568175240219530394">Scyrenus</a></b>:</div>Doubt. Before the AI-prompt era, I already had a library of games that I would never finish in my lifetime because of the obvious human mortality.<br><br>AI will help me slow down on purchases and focus on the old stuff. </blockquote>You will just abandon your backlog again because new mindblowing stuff made with AI will arrive, and you won't care, you will just enjoy. </blockquote>Knowing my snobby ahh, I absolutely doubt it. After all I do keep playing old games over and over again even now. + I will always care, I love watching and studying behind the scenes to see how stuff is made.			</div>
